        "Description": "47, this is getting out of hand: Sheikh Al-Ghazali doesn&apos;t want to give us the money for the assignments. Also we have intel informations about undercover agents from Zombey&apos;s company in the ICA. We&apos;re not sure if we can trust our informant so you need to kill another undercover agent in the Burj Al-Ghazali and get the informations we need. \rSo your contract is: Kill Omar Al-Ghazali and the undercover agent Mas&apos;ood Abad, get the informations, find an exit and get finally out of that building",
